## 4. Enterprise Platforms & Cloud Add-ons
Depending on whether you deploy the standard foundation or a complete cloud platform, vSphere layers into these larger toolsets: [1, 2] 

* 
* vSphere Kubernetes Service (VKS / Tanzu): Built-in container orchestrators that sit directly inside the ESXi kernel. This allows platform admins to provision, secure, and manage Kubernetes clusters side-by-side with standard virtual machines.
* VMware Cloud Foundation Operations (VCF Ops / Aria): Advanced multi-tenant logging and operations software. It analyzes capacity trends, predicts hardware shortfalls, and uses smart dashboards to pinpoint application slowdowns.
* VMware Site Recovery Manager (SRM): A disaster recovery automation engine. It coordinates failovers, maps IP schemes, and tests business continuity plans by turning on your workloads at a recovery data center. [1, 11, 15, 16] 
